      "message": "Convert k8s/ from Kustomize to Helm\n\nPer the org-wide rule \"kustomize is forbidden\" (2026-05-16).\n\nSame pattern as auth#11:\n  k8s/\n    Chart.yaml         # leaf chart, no deps\n    values.yaml        # image.repository + image.tag (sed-bumped by CI)\n    templates/\n      serviceaccount.yaml\n      deployment.yaml  # image: `{{ .Values.image.repository }}:{{ .Values.image.tag }}`\n      service.yaml\n      certificate.yaml\n      xlistenerset.yaml\n      httproute.yaml\n\nvalues.yaml seeded with the currently-running tag (f02f97a) so ArgoCD's\nfirst re-render under Helm shows zero meaningful diff against the live\ncluster.\n\nbuild-and-deploy.yaml updates:\n- Drops the flaky `Install kustomize` step\n- Replaces `kustomize edit set image …` with sed on values.yaml\n- Updates the git-commit step to track values.yaml\n\nArgoCD auto-detects Helm by Chart.yaml presence — the\nk8s/apps/kill-me.yaml Application manifest in infra-bootstrap doesn't\nneed any changes; same `path: k8s` works.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
